# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Page screenshots -- captured by hand from `make serve-local` for review.
# Build output of a review step, not source: they are regenerated whenever the
# page changes, and ten full-page PNGs at two widths would be committed binary
# that nothing reads. Kept OUT of the tree's history deliberately.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
page-screens/
